.1 (its owner); this document links, does not restate.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"2def1ce67cdf\"><p local-id=\"37d71dfb8849\">PWA TSD owner</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"dea7a515b4a2\"><td ac:local-id=\"3724e8a12207\"><p local-id=\"8e814bae2af1\">Handoff Boundary table still marked <code>[FOR UPDATE]</code>.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"df922388f294\"><p local-id=\"b02d85762f9f\">Med</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"7c94f63c2e71\"><p local-id=\"4bea1a84fa70\">Tim to finalise (Appendix A).</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"3c2b6bb72865\"><p local-id=\"de2031db92f6\">Tim Lavelle</p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr data-layout=\"wide\" data-width=\"760\" local-id=\"7e52a79e90c9\"/><h2 local-id=\"8b01c727e8e7\">8. Decision Record</h2><table ac:local-id=\"a621d42e421b\" data-layout=\"center\" data-table-width=\"1267\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 123.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 316.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 435.0px;\"/><col style=\"width: 388.0px;\"/></colgroup><tbody><tr ac:local-id=\"9fe7fd0df8e9\"><th ac:local-id=\"916839c67a26\"><p local-id=\"14d20d948063\">Date</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"120168c22a30\"><p local-id=\"47b3dd3b2ccd\">Decision Maker</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"adf4ce615beb\"><p local-id=\"c5d48a4fd2ac\">Decision</p></th><th ac:local-id=\"3069fcb5d140\"><p local-id=\"a544b7a56e0b\">Outcome / Rationale</p></th></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"1bdf6cd2a94d\"><td ac:local-id=\"5a940c037075\"><p local-id=\"085ed18425e0\">Jul 2026</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"e2c8b86d404c\"><p local-id=\"98f6977f7986\">Squad-A design (SA endorsement TBC)</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"17ed9912b108\"><p local-id=\"e44e5d4203ac\">SFCC product/category IDs stored as non-localized ShortText fields; conditional rendering resolved in the MRT SSR layer; presentation-only components hold no ID-matching logic; cache keys include the SFCC ID.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f21180cbe8e2\"><p local-id=\"ed1c6d9ef1cf\">The core design question of the spike. Proposed design, not yet implemented; not endorsed by the SA in review - co