      "body": "User:557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8 Thanks for this review! \nI’ve asked Dani for some input, and we’ve come to these conclusions: \n\n1. Rotation time should be configurable and depends on the length of the message. The duration needs to be adjusted to cover the message. So 3 seconds is definitely not fixed, I’ll update that in the AC. \n1. With regards to Pause, does the 'x' as Close button not cover the ability that one must be able to stop this rotating element from happening?\n1. Can confirm ‘x' will close all messages in the banner, not just the one currently displayed. I’ll update AC. \n1. If that banner is displayed in any other pages, it will remain closed if the user has used ‘x' to close it already in that session, so we do need to find a way to ensure it’s not persisted. I’ll update AC.\n1. Yes, created spike for that in sprint 1.\n1. User:712020:08a6f120-c836-4f71-92db-c97999401c49 think this one is relevant for the TSD as well. This banner is def currently available on PLP and PDP pages.",
